  "limitations": [
    "Warm synchronous host API calls that enqueue and/or drain promise jobs; no I/O, timers, Node or WASM bindings.",
    "enqueue times source evaluation only; its job cleanup is outside timing. checkpoint prepares pending jobs outside timing.",
    "source_completed includes source evaluation and all pending jobs. call_completed retains start() and includes a checkpoint on both engines.",
    "Every invocation checks exactly one numeric completion and no rejection outside timing. Cyclic GC runs outside each batch on both engines.",
    "napi-vm caches invocation source; rquickjs reparses it. Context construction and setup are excluded.",
    "Job counts are engine-specific diagnostics, not equal units of work. Five warmups do not prove equal tiers.",
    "Samples are per-call timer averages; no host isolation or enforced affinity.",
    "Aggregate statistics are medians/MAD of independent process medians; all child batch samples are retained."
  ]
